Mode is the value which occurs most frequently in a set of observations. For example, {6, 3, 9, 6, 6, 5, 9, 3} the Mode is 6, as it occurs most often.



Fact about Mode : 

Sometimes there can be more than one mode.Having two modes is called bimodal.Having more than two modes is called multimodal.There is an empirical relationship between Mean, Median, and Mode. Mean – Mode = 3 [ Mean – Median ]

